* Deterministic transforms

invert(MelodicFigure fig)
retrograde(MelodicFigure fig)

combine(MelodicFigure mf1, MelodicFigure mf2, int step = 0, bool elide = false)
replicate(MelodicFigure fig, int repeats, int step = 0, bool elide = false)
replicate(MelodicFigure fig, StepSequence ss)

-- these 2 will be called when realizing figure connector w/ elide n expand
prune(MelodicFigure fig, int count, bool from_start = false)
set_last_pulse(float duration)

* Free-form (randomized) transforms

complexify(MelodicFigure fig) // keep length, increase steps via repeats, turns, etc.
embellish(MelodicFigure fig, int count) // add ornaments and articulations

vary(MelodicFigure fig)

* Specialize
replicate_and_prune(MelodicFigure fig, StepSequence ss, pruneStep1, pruneStep2 = 0)
